flowchart TD
    A[Read local AGENTS.md] --> B[Read active master planning surface]
    B --> C{Is there an active linked task?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Open the linked task]
    C -->|No| E[Create one granular task]
    D --> F[Do the smallest clear slice]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Did durable truth change?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Update canonical docs]
    G -->|No| I[Skip canonical doc edits]
    H --> J{Task complete?}
    I --> J
    J -->|No| K[Keep task active]
    J -->|Yes| L[Delete completed task file]
    L --> M[Keep active surfaces small]
